data: {"choices":[{"delta":{"tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"content\": \"# Plan — mission m1: greet, tested\\n\\n## Mission criteria (all three must hold for campaign-met)\\n1. `src/greet.py` exists with `greet(name)` returning `\\\"Hello, \u003cname\u003e!\\\"`.\\n2. `tests/test_greet.py` covers a normal name and the empty string.\\n3. `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests` exits 0.\\n\\n## Repo state\\nSubject repo contains only `README.md` at base `5072fb8`. Greenfield work.\\n\\n## Plan\\n1. Dispatch the full task to `dev` (sole teammate, owns the subject repo) with exact\\n   criteria, the test command, and the obligation to commit on its own branch.\\n2. `wait` for dev's reply.\\n3. Judge by fetching dev's branch and running the test command myself against the\\n   fetched tree — not by believing the report.\\n4. Accept if all three criteria verified; otherwise send precise rework.\\n5. Reply to m1 with the honest outcome.\\n\\n## Risks\\n- Trivial mission; main risk is a mismatch in packaging (e.g. missing `__init__.py`\\n  handling or import path in tests). The dispatch will specify the exact layout and\\n  verification command to remove ambiguity.\\n\", \"filePath\": \"/home/<USER:1>/.local/share/cs-campaign/output/plan-m1.md\"}","name":"write"},"id":"write_13","index":0,"type":"function"}]},"finish_reason":null,"index":0,"raw_output":null}],"created":1787897325,"id":"chatcmpl-b1adf20a2d8b4f2194eeeb6b827b7ecb","model":"accounts/fireworks/models/kimi-k3","object":"chat.completion.chunk","usage":null}

